title: Chopsticks
text: A SPLITTER lets half of a beam straight through and bounces the other half off at a right angle. It works backwards too: two beams that meet in a splitter mix, and the mixed colour leaves both ways. Red and green make yellow.
trick: splitter merge: both outputs carry the mix
motif: chopsticks
ink: 2.5
expect: merges>=1
